This crate (`symphonia-codec-dca`) is a pure-Rust DTS Coherent Acoustics (DCA) decoder, written
for Project Symphonia (licensed under the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0, see `LICENSE`).

The decoder is a port of the DCA decoder of FFmpeg (libavcodec), which is distributed under the
GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or (at your option) any later version. The port was
made from upstream FFmpeg, git commit 946fcce07b6d, files:

  libavcodec/dca.c, dca.h, dca_core.c, dca_core.h, dca_exss.c, dcadec.c, dcadsp.c, dcamath.h,
  dcaadpcm.c/.h, dcahuff.c/.h, dcadata.c, dca_syncwords.h, synth_filter.c, dca_xll.c, dca_xll.h,
  dcadct.c, dca_lbr.c, dca_lbr.h

