The bitstream syntax is defined by ETSI TS 102 114 ("DTS Coherent Acoustics; Core and Extensions
with Additional Profiles"), which was used as the specification reference.

The FFmpeg `ffmpeg` binary was used unmodified, as an external decoder oracle and as an encoder
for test streams during development. Test streams under `tests/data/` were generated from
synthetic sine tones by FFmpeg's native DCA encoder.
